me="tap_to_change">Tap to change time</string><string name="test_notification">Send Test Notification (2s delay)</string><string name="notification_enabled">Daily reminder enabled ✓</string><string name="notification_disabled">Daily reminder disabled</string><string name="notification_rescheduled">Notification rescheduled ✓</string><string name="test_notification_sent">Test notification coming in 2 seconds…</string><string name="language_changed">Language updated. Restart the app to fully apply.</string><string name="about_text">Thirukkural is a classic Tamil text consisting of 1,330 couplets (kurals) on virtue, wealth and love, authored by the poet-philosopher Thiruvalluvar.\n\nThis app delivers one Kural per day in sequential order, with Tamil explanation and English translation — completing all 1,330 kurals in about 3.6 years before cycling again.</string><string name="today_label">Today\'s Kural</string><string name="book_aram">Book of Virtue</string><string name="book_porul">Book of Wealth</string><string name="book_inbam">Book of Love</string></file><file path="C:\Users\sivai\StudioProjects\Thinam-oru-kural\ThirukkuralApp\app\src\main\res\values\themes.xml" qualifiers=""><style name="Theme.Thirukkural" parent="Theme.MaterialComponents.Light.NoActionBar">
